OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening and night with clear spells
OL,7,Ffor most, allowing it to turn rather
OL,8,Fcold with perhaps a touch of frost
OL,9,Fforming in prone spots. The odd light
OL,10,Fshower around coasts not to be ruled
OL,11,Fout.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,14,Frisk of frost. Then remaining dry and
OL,15,Fsettled through the day with plenty of
OL,16,Fsunshine and just a few patches of
OL,17,Fcloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
