OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry Sunday with sunshine, the odd
OL,7,Fshower possible in the southeast.
OL,8,FPartly cloudy on Monday with some
OL,9,Fsunny spells. Turning cloudier on
OL,10,FTuesday with the risk of patchy rain.
